  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 21/12/2022). Our client Rahul Krishnan is a 73-year-old civil engineer who lives at Flat 12D, Satellite, Ahmedabad 380028 and can be reached on 94749 04051 or rahul.krishnan@example.in. The client's PAN QQFPK6115A.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Bhosale Enterprises. A cheque for INR 26,10,000/- issued by Bhosale Enterprises bounced: the cheque came back with the remark account closed.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 921283469849 (IFSC KKBK0853547).\nThe matter was filed as CC/1128/2023 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Ahmedabad on 18 March 2023.",
